WEBVTT

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.540
<i>Now displaying incidents, accidents,</i>

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:12.260
<i>and rumors relating to Umbra within the 
city of London in order of credibility.</i>

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:13.820
Number 11.

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.120
Rewind two seconds. Eight frames.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.080
Is this real, or a composite image?

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:26.000
It's certainly a well-made pumpkin.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:27.040
However...

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:29.300
Enlarge this area.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.300
There's something there.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.470
Compensating.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.640
I've seen this wolf in the reports.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.130
Organize an assault team.

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.060
We'll depart within 15 minutes.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:44.730
Yes, sir!

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:49.640
Thank you, God.

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:30.080
<i>Want to take a break?</i>

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:31.590
No, keep going.

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:34.460
<b>Episode 6 Midnight Sun</b>

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:34.420
<i>Should I do some filtering on my end, then?</i>

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:38.350
Don't. I wouldn't want to 
miss any important clues.

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:39.300
<i>Got it.</i>

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:45.740
Anyway, researching urban 
legends online was a good idea.

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:49.020
<i>Fearsome ghosts, fairies, and monsters.</i>

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:55.060
<i>Most people say rumors of such 
inhuman creatures are nonsense,</i>

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.360
<i>but they are in fact wrong.</i>

00:02:56.360 --> 00:03:00.000
Nothing's more human than 
rumors of inhuman creatures.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.320
They create Umbra, right?

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:09.290
<i>Yeah, so where there are rumors, 
it's highly likely they exist.</i>

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:15.790
In other words, Shinyao's kidnapper 
Chris is in a place people fear?

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:19.510
<i>It's just a little probable.</i>

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:22.280
But it's worth investigating.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.720
I'm impressed, Wayne.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:26.650
<i>Unlike the other three, I'm not strong,</i>

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:28.950
<i>so I have to use my head.</i>

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:32.990
<i>My only power is the ability 
to possess objects.</i>

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:34.600
<i>And I have no memories,</i>

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:37.480
<i>so the information I've gathered 
is all I know about the past.</i>

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.690
Vlad found you in a state of amnesia

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:43.660
while you were possessing a doll, right?

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:46.060
<i>If only my memories would return...</i>

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:51.500
<i>If I knew who I was, 
I'd probably be more useful.</i>

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:55.320
Wayne, even if you don't have old memories,

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:56.790
you have knowledge of the present.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:04:01.040
You provide the others with support.

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:04.760
Only you could do that, Wayne.

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:06.970
<i>Miss...</i>

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:10.340
Besides, if you hadn't come up with a plan,

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:13.180
Vlad would be spending all day in his coffin

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:16.360
while Luke spends all day baking.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.790
<i>You're so mean.</i>

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:21.690
<i>You're the most useless of all.</i>

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:22.900
Wait.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:23.780
<i>Sorry! I was just kidding!</i>

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:24.420
Not that.

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:25.570
Enlarge this image.

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:30.040
<i>A jack-o'-lantern? Think it's real?</i>

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.790
More importantly, this hat on its head.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.080
It's Shinyao's.

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:36.240
<i>Really?</i>

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.830
Yes, I'm sure.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.670
Bravo!

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.370
Bravo to you.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:50.640
What are you doing?

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.070
I thought we could eat together.

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:54.930
It's an Umbra.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:56.590
Like you.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:58.600
That's right.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:04.030
Like the man who kidnapped you, 
it's a monster that harms people.

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.280
It's cute.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:12.820
Get back.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:14.760
We're surrounded.

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:23.280
Can't we get any closer?

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:24.010
No.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:28.180
We're downwind, but if we get 
any closer he'll smell us.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.080
You do stink like beasts.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.470
They're pheromones for attracting women!

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:33.950
Quiet, both of you.

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:37.190
Wolves have keen ears in addition to noses.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:39.280
How long will we wait, then?

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.230
Even if we wait until dark, 
doesn't he have good night vision?

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:44.370
We need a plan first.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:47.990
Should we surround him or charge in together?

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:51.240
Why not openly walk up and talk to him?

00:05:51.460 --> 00:05:54.660
If I go, Chris will dig his heels in.

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:57.500
What a difficult brother.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.400
Toryu! You, too?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:04.490
What's that?

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:05.880
Who are they?

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:13.890
Is he trying to run now that he's noticed us?

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:16.670
Wait!

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:20.480
Chris?

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.140
What's going on?

00:06:22.140 --> 00:06:24.230
Didn't his allies come to rescue him?

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.190
Luke! Don't jump the gun!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:34.050
Toryu, cover me.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.160
Just don't shoot anyone.

00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:37.120
What should I do?

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:42.010
Chris!

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:46.170
I'm counting on you, Vlad!

00:06:58.250 --> 00:06:59.940
Are you okay, Vlad?

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:01.940
Am I okay?

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:03.460
We let them escape.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.240
What's this?

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:07.490
Anti-radar chaff.

00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:09.350
They killed my sense of direction.

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:10.610
With this?

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:15.410
Did they know I'd use my bat powers?

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:23.500
Who are you?

00:07:24.280 --> 00:07:26.580
What are you going to do with us?

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:30.970
You've been thoroughly 
brainwashed by the Umbra.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.440
It's all right now.

00:07:33.440 --> 00:07:36.890
You've been saved, human girl.

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:42.900
You're a tough one.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.060
It's meaningless to torture me.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.570
Besides, I'm not your enemy.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:51.400
This isn't an interrogation. It's punishment.

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:56.120
Umbra like you are shadows 
that shouldn't exist.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:58.370
Then why not kill me?

00:07:58.370 --> 00:07:59.960
I won't right away.

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:04.020
I'll make you taste the suffering you 
inflicted on the girl you kidnapped.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:05.790
What are you going to do to Shinyao?

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:08.980
You're the one who was trying 
to do something to her.

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:12.990
You kidnapped a helpless girl 
so you could offer her up to an Umbra.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:14.800
Truly the work of a demon.

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:18.140
Your Haysin's the one who 
came up with the idea.

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.550
Haysin! That heretic!

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:23.210
He hunts shadows for his own pleasure,

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:25.670
even if it involves other humans.

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:28.270
He's practically an Umbra. 
A failure of a human.

00:08:28.710 --> 00:08:31.070
At least we agree on that.

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:35.680
HQ was insistent that we include 
him in our numbers,

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:37.830
but it was the wrong decision.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:43.080
That's why I returned in order
 to take direct control.

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:48.790
Tell me everything he knows
 and everything he's trying to do.

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:51.550
If you'll guarantee Shinyao's safety.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.650
You don't need to ask.

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:58.290
The Midnight Sun will do everything 
they can to protect her.

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:00.760
So I can trust you?

00:09:01.050 --> 00:09:04.730
I don't seek relationships 
of mutual trust with Umbra.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.490
What do you want to know first?

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:13.690
I see. Shinyao really was there.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:16.910
Sorry, Ton. We let them escape.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:19.680
You don't need to apologize.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.730
After all, you did your best.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:25.440
Vlad, Luke, and Toryu.

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.670
Wayne, too, of course.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:30.660
Besides, we don't have time to mope.

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.300
We need to come up with our next move.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:38.340
Anyway, who were those guys who took them?

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:42.310
Who else has Chris antagonized besides us?

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:45.850
They were clearly taken by humans.

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:51.080
They used modern human technology 
instead of Umbra powers.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:55.870
That helicopter alone 
must be fairly expensive.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:10:00.070
Not even the Twilights have those 
kinds of financial resources.

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:04.780
If we had money, we wouldn't 
be working at this café.

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.810
An organization with 
plenty of money and tech.

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:13.840
Snowmary is the most suspicious organization.

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:17.680
That company that developed the Magic Mirror?

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:23.020
The Magic Mirror's come up several 
times in this series of incidents,

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:27.810
as if it's trying to lead 
Ton towards her enemies.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:30.700
It's promoted as a meddlesome app,

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:33.950
but sometimes it's a bit too meddlesome, huh?

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:38.060
Are you saying you sense some kind 
of purpose behind its actions?

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:39.950
And today's attack...

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:43.370
If they're capable of 
something on that scale,

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.440
the entire company might be involved.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:49.570
So you've found out that much.

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:52.210
Impressive for an Umbra.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:53.840
Who are you?

00:10:54.180 --> 00:10:57.320
You know exactly who I am.

00:10:57.320 --> 00:11:02.010
We've fought countless times throughout 
history in the shadows and the light.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.470
Midnight Sun.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:05.350
Huh? What?!

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:07.060
Which means...

00:11:07.410 --> 00:11:08.750
I see.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:10.770
You're Van Helsing.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.400
Yes, the 13th.

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:15.490
I've kept you waiting, Count.

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:25.490
Midnight Sun?

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:27.440
Van Helsing?

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:29.330
Who's that? What's going on?

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.210
Let me tell you, girl,

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:36.000
of the longstanding battle 
between humans and Umbra.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:43.180
Umbra were first properly recognized 
during World War One.

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:48.330
All wars have been caused 
by a certain Umbra seeking to prosper

00:11:48.330 --> 00:11:54.650
by sowing fear and confusion 
throughout the world.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.920
They may have been caused by Umbra,

00:11:57.920 --> 00:12:00.240
but humans were the ones who 
actually fought the wars.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:03.710
Correct. Fearing the darkness,

00:12:03.710 --> 00:12:07.830
humans fell victim to illusions of Umbra
 and began killing one another.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.200
Realizing they were a serious threat,

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:14.460
the nations of the world decided to enact 
Umbra countermeasures not on a national scale,

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.940
but an international one.

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:18.800
That is how Midnight Sun was formed.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:22.780
They're an organization founded on 
the idea of purging human society

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:27.300
of the poison that is Umbra 
and exterminating them.

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:33.020
But as the World War wrapped up,
 the world changed again.

00:12:33.260 --> 00:12:38.180
The world began to desire harmony, 
not hatred towards Umbra.

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:41.080
Coexistence, not extermination.

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:44.650
The Twilights gained power,

00:12:44.650 --> 00:12:47.670
and Midnight Sun fell into the minority.

00:12:47.670 --> 00:12:51.160
With nowhere to go, they hid underground.

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:55.870
In the past few years, they haven't 
been able to operate fully.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.950
Yes, a humiliating time for us.

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:03.540
Three years ago, I established Snowmary alone

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:08.720
and poured all the technology and funds
 I acquired into Midnight Sun.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:12.110
What? You developed the Magic Mirror?

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:12.930
That's amazing!

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:13.680
Wayne.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:17.470
As Midnight Sun's major sponsor,

00:13:17.470 --> 00:13:22.070
I participated in their activities 
by hunting Umbra across Europe.

00:13:22.070 --> 00:13:27.780
Eventually I was given the name
 Van Helsing, the first Umbra hunter.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.580
An Umbra hunter?

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.450
Then you're like my great-grandmother.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:34.250
This butcher is nothing like Rijan!

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:39.250
Rijan fought for coexistence 
and sometimes even to save Umbra.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:42.710
The difference between him
 and her virtue is heaven and earth!

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:43.960
Vlad...

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:50.010
I have no intention of discussing 
our ideology with you, Count.

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.720
That discussion ended a century ago.

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:55.850
And ten generations of Helsings ago.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:14:00.690
So what's a human supremacist 
like you doing harming humans?

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:05.110
Does the Midnight Sun's 
doctrine say it's okay

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.320
to involve a human girl to kidnap Chris?

00:14:08.250 --> 00:14:11.030
You're right, wolf.

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:12.180
What?!

00:14:12.180 --> 00:14:13.350
Baileu Ton.

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:17.400
Sha Rijan's great-granddaughter 
and future Umbra hunter.

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:18.000
Huh?

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:20.830
My men have caused you trouble.

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:23.800
I shall return Mu Shinyao to you.

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:37.940
Hey, Vlad.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:38.880
What?

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:41.030
Can we trust him?

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:44.590
Would I trust the words 
of a human named Helsing?

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:46.400
Now that's a funny joke.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:49.910
You've never read Bram Stoker's <i>Dracula</i>?

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:51.860
That's not what I meant.

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:55.960
I'll tell you the location 
of your friend later.

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:57.580
Come get her.

00:14:58.110 --> 00:14:59.950
However, I have several conditions.

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:03.210
Don't tell the Umbra 
where she is. Come alone.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:07.020
Once you're reunited, 
you must never return here.

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:09.680
Forget everything about the incident.

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:13.030
Both you and her are too 
sympathetic to Umbra.

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:16.520
At this rate, you'll get lost in the shadows.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:21.380
I don't want to see anyone else 
become unhappy because of Umbra.

00:15:23.510 --> 00:15:27.070
His words are skewed towards human logic.

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.950
Yeah, but...

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:35.020
The one thing I can say is that those who call 
themselves Helsing are cold towards Umbra,

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:38.710
but they're definitely loyal to humans.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:42.100
Do you want me to go?

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:44.670
Don't you care if I never return?

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:51.470
If that will help you save your friend, 
it's a small price to pay.

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:59.620
What should I do?

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:01.250
Huh?

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:02.800
What is it?

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:04.230
I can't find Luke.

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.230
What?

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.480
I believe he followed that man.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:08.440
I see.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:14.370
I doubt the man calling himself Helsing
will allow Luke's brother to live much longer.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.080
Luke...

00:16:16.360 --> 00:16:20.180
Facing that man alone would be suicide.

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.080
We'll split up and look for him.

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:25.890
Contact me if you find him.

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:27.920
Don't try to fight him alone.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.130
Is he that strong?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:35.840
All Helsings have been exceptionally skilled.

00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:39.960
Not that I've ever lost to one.

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:48.110
Come on out, wolf.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.390
When did you notice?

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:53.740
From the moment I saw your eyes at the café.

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:57.100
So you've already taken into 
account that I'd follow you.

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:58.450
Did you come alone?

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.890
This is my business.

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:03.160
I can't involve the others.

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:05.970
Umbra never learn.

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:08.040
They always act alone.

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.830
I don't care!

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:11.520
Where's Chris?

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:15.880
And they quickly become emotional 
and lose control of themselves.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.100
Truly terrible for humankind.

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:20.500
I didn't come to negotiate!

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:22.030
I came to make demands!

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:24.940
I will use force to make you obey, then.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.880
This is my turf.

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:28.740
I've already cleared the area of people.

00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:30.650
We can fight to our heart's content.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.280
I appreciate it!

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:44.840
Whoa!

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:45.750
I see.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:46.790
Silver bullets.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.210
He's done his research.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.590
When our abilities are so different,
 it's not even a fight.

00:17:55.590 --> 00:17:58.630
Well, I am human.

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:03.060
I don't have your superhuman 
speed or strength.

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:05.600
Why are you so calm, then?

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.050
Because I'm human.

00:18:08.050 --> 00:18:10.590
Unlike you, I think.

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:11.320
Oh, really?

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:14.780
For example, no matter what happens, 
you won't kill me.

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.990
You need me to tell you 
where your brother is.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:20.660
Even if I don't kill you, I might hurt 
you so badly you'll wish you were dead.

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.120
Of course. However...

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:32.170
It's monkshood, wolf.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.570
Bastard...

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:36.440
Also known as wolfsbane.

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:38.680
It's a poison that kills wolves.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:41.480
What's wrong, proud wolfman?

00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:46.390
The more faithful you are to your folklore,

00:18:46.390 --> 00:18:48.600
the more effective your weaknesses.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:57.050
<i>You've received an invitation 
from Mr. Van Helsing.</i>

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:57.650
What?

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.630
<i>Sha Rijan's doll.</i>

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:14.800
<i>Can you see with those eyes?</i>

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:16.790
Luke.

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:18.180
Come alone.

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:21.160
Otherwise the next bullet's 
going through his heart.

00:19:23.930 --> 00:19:25.600
Come alone.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.320
You must never return here.

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:30.040
Forget everything about the incident.

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:37.530
You kept our promise and came alone.

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:41.160
Umbras are always such thoughtless fools.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:46.870
Is threatening a hostage something humans do?

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:52.000
Unfortunately, my chivalry 
doesn't extend to Umbra.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:53.330
Where is Luke?

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:57.960
If you take me hostage, 
we may be able to make a deal.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:14.040
I struggled to come with 
countermeasures against you, doll.

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:16.980
You have no real weaknesses.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:19.820
After all, you feel no pain.
 You have no heart.

00:20:19.820 --> 00:20:21.700
I have a heart.

00:20:21.700 --> 00:20:26.610
I can't even touch the talisman 
that is your only weakness.

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:33.790
I can't get your talisman, but this...

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:38.810
What is this?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.010
Liquid nitrogen, doll.

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:50.090
At 200 degrees below zero,
 even an Umbra will freeze.

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:32.330
<i>It's your turn, Count.</i>

00:22:35.200 --> 00:23:31.970
<b>Phantom 
Twilight Plus</b>

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:37.320
Phantom in the Twilight Plus!

00:22:38.770 --> 00:22:42.590
This time we'll be talking about the 
Twilights Organization we belong to.

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:44.450
Watch episode two again. That's all.

00:22:44.450 --> 00:22:46.020
You lazy vampire!

00:22:46.020 --> 00:22:48.430
At least properly introduce 
your own organization!

00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:54.310
A hundred years ago, the Twilights were 
formed by Rijan and several other members.

00:22:54.310 --> 00:22:56.430
I still remember the event, 
so I'm sure of it.

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:00.220
Based on our ideals, 
we're known as a balanced group.

00:23:00.220 --> 00:23:02.470
We don't simply destroy Umbra.

00:23:02.470 --> 00:23:06.280
We also save those who don't harm humans.

00:23:06.540 --> 00:23:10.910
That's why even nuisances like yourselves 
are able to lead happy lives.

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:13.780
Currently we have branches 
all over the world.

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:15.790
They handle Umbra incidents in their areas.

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:19.010
So there are teams like 
ours all over the world.

00:23:19.010 --> 00:23:23.710
But the London branch was established first, 
with ancient and honorable origins and a long—

00:23:23.710 --> 00:23:24.920
It's just a café, though.

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:26.320
Don't make light of us.

00:23:26.320 --> 00:23:29.260
We possess a great and unique power.

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:30.550
What's that?

00:23:30.920 --> 00:23:32.560
We have the best tea in the world.

00:23:32.560 --> 00:23:33.540
Oh...

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:34.470
Yeah, yeah.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:50.070
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:35.500 --> 00:23:38.540
True to his word, Mr. Helsing 
reunited me with Shinyao.

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:40.770
Thanks. Now if you'll excuse me...

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:42.880
I knew it wouldn't be that easy.

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:45.600
It's time for us to escape, Shinyao.

00:23:45.600 --> 00:23:47.070
By force, of course.

00:23:47.030 --> 00:23:50.070
<b>Episode 7 Awakening of the Century</b>

00:23:47.390 --> 00:23:49.710
Next time: Awakening of the Century.
